            # have a match.  If the compiler doesn't support
            # ISO_C_BINDING, C_SHORT_FLOAT, or C_SHORT_FLOAT_COMPLEX,
            # then we'll just fall back to a default kind and hope
            # for the best.  :-\

    # Use of m4_translit suggested by Eric Blake:
